SCOPE / GELTUNGSBEREICH

This MIT License covers the original source code and the original texts of
CELLULA (e.g. dist/*.js, dist/*.html, dist/*.css, scripts/, desktop/,
start.py, docs/), including the procedurally generated cell and process models.

The explanatory texts in dist/knowledge.js are original German summaries based
on OpenStax "Biology 2e" (Clark, Douglas, Choi; Rice University), licensed
under CC BY 4.0. Anyone redistributing them must keep that attribution
(see NOTICE.md).

It does NOT cover the following third-party components, which remain under
their own terms (see NOTICE.md):

  * dist/assets/molecules*  – atomic coordinates from the Worldwide Protein
                     Data Bank (wwPDB), dedicated to the public domain under
                     CC0 1.0 (dist/assets/LICENSE.txt)
  * dist/vendor/*  – three.js, (c) three.js authors, MIT License
                     (dist/vendor/LICENSE)

CELLULA is an educational tool. See RECHTLICHES.md for the intended purpose,
disclaimer and privacy information.
